		VertexStripTrailsExperimental: {
			Label: Experimental Strip Trails
			Tooltip: Experimental. Body trails use the Catmull-Rom ribbon by default (same renderer as the dev yoyo). Tick this to try the vertex-strip/shader renderer instead - it can pinch and look broken wherever the trail reverses direction.
		}

		SoftTrails: {
			Label: Soft Trails
			Tooltip: Soft feathered streak ribbons with a smooth taper and a soft additive hot core. Untick for the old hard-edged ribbon. The dev yoyo always keeps the old ribbon.
		}

		DutchmanSmokeRings: {
			Label: Dutchman Smoke Rings
			Tooltip: Untick to remove the broadside smoke-ring puffs on cannon volleys.
		}

		DarkMageRuneRing: {
			Label: Dark Mage Rune Ring
			Tooltip: Untick to remove the converging rune ring at the ritual's spawn.
		}

		OgreCrackDecal: {
			Label: Ogre Crack Decal
			Tooltip: Untick to remove the club-land ground crack and dirt-chip arcs.
		}

		DarkMageStar: {
			Label: DarkMage Arcane Star
			Tooltip: Style of the smooth star the ritual's magic bolt stamps on hit. Off keeps the vanilla sparkle.
		}

